        {
            "id": "n-string-1768578990396",
            "type": "string",
            "position": {
                "x": 48,
                "y": 800,
                "width": 328,
                "height": 288
            },
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "data": {
                "value": "for iteratively solving camera position for a moving camera in a video:\n\nposition a fixed camera on frame 0\n\nthen change timeline to frame n \n\nmove video position keyframe until background objects line up\n\nlock video keyframe"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "n-string-1768579294163",
            "type": "string",
            "position": {
                "x": 48,
                "y": 1120,
                "width": 328,
                "height": 232
            },
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "data": {
                "value": "depth correction can be done in a similar manner\n\nmatching pixels => strong alignment + strong depth confidence\n\n=> move non matching pixels towards the depth of their confident neighbors"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "n-string-1768579515036",
            "type": "string",
            "position": {
                "x": -360,
                "y": 912,
                "width": 328,
                "height": 184
            },
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "data": {
                "value": "image flow ai could be used to seed this\n\nalso camera physics can be used for smoothing (though rotation has near 0 friction there is still momentum for the holder of the camera, aside from instability)"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "n-string-1768579935448",
            "type": "string",
            "position": {
                "x": 56,
                "y": 1400,
                "width": 320,
                "height": 320
            },
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "data": {
                "value": "3d image flow => high quality patch\n\nonce depth is more precise, 3d image flow can be calculated.\n\nthis gives a basic for patch motion (a patch would be a gradient of 3d image flow vectors)\n\nthis would allow projecting patches across time and filling in obfuscated areas (or enhancing patch pixel resolution)"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "n-string-1768580400342",
            "type": "string",
            "position": {
                "x": 472,
                "y": 1400,
                "width": 328,
                "height": 320
            },
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "data": {
                "value": "scene view with camera locked to a patch\n\ndisplay patch from all frames at once\n\nmatching pixels indicate good alignment, anchor points\n\n=> adjust depth and 3d flow vectors towards anchor point values"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "n-string-1768580422984",
            "type": "string",
            "position": {
                "x": 480,
                "y": 808,
                "width": 312,
                "height": 280
            },
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "data": {
                "value": "scene view with a camera locked to a projection camera position at a specific frame\n\n=> adjust the current frame camera position to align the most pixels"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "n-string-1768580510888",
            "type": "string",
            "position": {
                "x": 480,
                "y": 1120,
                "width": 312,
                "height": 232
            },
            "inputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "outputs": [
                {
                    "name": "value",
                    "type": "string"
                }
            ],
            "data": {
                "value": "scene view with a camera locked to a project camera position at a specific frame,\n\n=> adjust the current frame depth based on matching pixels => pull neighbors"
            }
        },
        {
            "id": "n-string-1768581736414",
